  "desktop.getWindowList": {
    "notes": "不需要会话（自己就是枚举）。这个命令的 outputs 是**整桌面**的窗口列表，内容随本机环境漂移——所以正路径只断言形状（有 windows 这个键），唯一能按值断言的是『一个都不匹配时是空列表』（那一条是确定的）。注意 matchMode 在这里缺省是 contains（与 attachWindow 的 exact 不同）。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "exact-pattern-finds-the-fixture-window",
        "inputs": {
          "titlePattern": "{appTitle}",
          "matchMode": "exact"
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "windows"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "contains-pattern-finds-a-title-substring",
        "inputs": {
          "titlePattern": "Desktop Demo",
          "matchMode": "contains"
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "windows"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "regex-pattern-matches-the-fixture-window",
        "inputs": {
          "titlePattern": "^RPA Core .*Demo$",
          "matchMode": "regex"
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "windows"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "unknown-pattern-yields-an-empty-list",
        "inputs": {
          "titlePattern": "no-such-window-probe-xyz-42",
          "matchMode": "exact"
        },
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "windows": []
          },
          "effect": "read"
        },
        "negative": true
      },
      {
        "name": "no-filter-declares-every-window",
        "inputs": {},
        "setup": {
          "session": "none"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputKeys": [
            "windows"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "desktop.getWindowTitle": {
    "notes": "窗口身份三项都来自实现（title / className / processId）。title 可以按值断言——装配就是靠这个标题 attach 成功的，两处必须一致，这条同时钉住了『attach 的标题匹配口径』与『读回来的标题』是同一个窗口。className 是 WinForms 动态生成的（WindowsForms10.Window.8.app.0.xxx），不按值断言。",
    "variants": [
      {
        "name": "reports-the-fixture-window-identity",
        "inputs": {
          "sessionId": "{session}"
        },
        "expect": {
          "outputs": {
            "title": "{appTitle}"
          },
          "outputKeys": [
            "title",
            "className",
            "processId"
          ],
          "effect": "read"
        }
      },
      {
